      "fields": {
        "log_label": "SYSTEM LOG >>",
        "text": "He went outside. He kicked the ball once, then twice. The air felt nice. He forgot to check the timer. 20 minutes later, he was still playing. The hardest part wasn't the practice, it was just standing up. Keep playing and grinding, because in real life, XP points are invisible right until the moment you finally level up."
      }
